      "updated_at": "2018-04-13T21:55:48Z",
      "body": "To know if the user is browsing from EU, we'd have to use an IP Geolocation service. I don't know any that's free.\r\nAs an easy workaround, we could detect the timezone of the user and from there extrapolate it's location. \r\n@kbariotis would you like to submit a PR doing that ?",
